<title>LATVIA: UNEMPLOYMENT RATE 7.6 PERCENT IN APRIL.</title>
<headline>UNEMPLOYMENT RATE 7.6 PERCENT IN APRIL.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvia's unemployment rate rose to 7.6 percent in April from 7.5 percent in March, the country's statistics comittee said on Friday.</p>
</text>
